{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52418","headline":"回波乐 六十一 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有此幻身来，寻思不自识。\n言从四大生，别有一种贼。\n能悉佛性眼，还如暗里墨。\n计此似神通，输回有智力。\n若欲具真如，勤苦修功德。\n佛在五荫中，努力向心克。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}